{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10196","headline":"送朱中舍游江东 · 李嘉佑","name":"送朱中舍游江东","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"孤城郭外送王孙，越水吴洲共尔论。\n野寺山边斜有迳，渔家竹里半开门。\n青枫独映摇前浦，白鹭闲飞过远村。\n若到西陵征战处，不堪秋草自伤魂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李嘉佑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10196.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10196","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}